{"title":"Algebra/Introduction","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Introductory_Topics_in_Algebra\">Introductory Topics in Algebra</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Introduction&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Introductory Topics in Algebra\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebraic_expression\" title=\"Algebraic expression\"> Algebraic expressions</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebraic_manipulation\" title=\"Algebraic manipulation\">Algebraic manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Substitution\" title=\"Substitution\">Substitution</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_number\" title=\"Complex number\"> Complex numbers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\"> Equations</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Linear_equation\" title=\"Linear equation\"> Linear equations</a> (1 and 2 variables)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=System_of_equations\" title=\"System of equations\"> Systems of equations</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factoring\" title=\"Factoring\">Factoring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\"> Functions</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Exponential_function\" title=\"Exponential function\"> Exponents</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Graph_of_a_function\" title=\"Graph of a function\"> Graphing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\"> Lines</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quadratic\"> Quadratics</a></li>\n<li>Basic <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Transformations\" title=\"Transformations\"> Transformations</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\"> Logarithms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Square_root\" title=\"Square root\">Square root</a> function</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polynomial\" title=\"Polynomial\"> Polynomials</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quadratic\"> Quadratics</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inequality\" title=\"Inequality\"> Inequalities</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trivial_inequality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trivial inequality\">Trivial inequality</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_Mean-Geometric_Mean\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arithmetic Mean-Geometric Mean\">Arithmetic Mean-Geometric Mean</a> inequality for 2 variables</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Word_problem\" title=\"Word problem\"> Word problems</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Introduction&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Intermediate\" title=\"Algebra/Intermediate\"> Intermediate algebra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Olympiad\" title=\"Algebra/Olympiad\"> Olympiad algebra</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032813\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 27/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 byte